  "dcterms:title": "Lao PDR: household on the CHW's roster",
  "dcterms:description": "How it is used: J2a. The CHW finds that a newborn is missing from the household roster and adds Somsack as a member.\n\nWhy: Lao community health work is organized by household. The roster is how a CHW notices that a child is missing, and it is the unit the family phone shares under in J4 (one phone, three profiles).",
